    "Restart OMP GUI to apply. English and Simplified Chinese are included; no download is needed." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重启 OMP GUI 后生效。已内置英语和简体中文，无需下载。"}}}},
