    "Dictation is ready. Click the microphone to record." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"听写已就绪，点击麦克风即可录音。"}}}},
    "The draft was replaced. Copy the transcript below to keep it." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"草稿已被替换。请复制下方的转写文字以保留内容。"}}}},
    "Dictation is active in another editor. Stop or cancel it there first." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"另一个编辑器正在听写，请先在那里停止或取消。"}}}},
    "On-device dictation is unavailable for this Mac or language. Choose a supported language." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这台 Mac 或所选语言不支持本机听写，请选择支持的语言。"}}}},
    "Dictation language assets are missing. Install them before recording." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"缺少听写语言资源，请先安装再录音。"}}}},
    "Microphone access is off. Enable OMP GUI in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Microphone." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"麦克风权限已关闭，请在“系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 麦克风”中允许 OMP GUI 使用麦克风。"}}}},
    "Recording failed. Check your microphone in System Settings → Sound and try again." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"录音失败，请在“系统设置 → 声音”中检查麦克风后重试。"}}}},
