    "Local dictation failed. Your draft has been kept. Check language assets and try again." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本地听写失败，草稿已保留。请检查语言资源后重试。"}}}},
    "OMP GUI records audio only when you start local dictation, then transcribes it on this Mac into your draft." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OMP GUI 仅在你开始本地听写时录音，然后在这台 Mac 上将语音转写到草稿中。"}}}},
