    "Browser sign-in is unavailable. Manage API keys here, or use OMP's terminal for other authentication methods." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"网页登录不可用。请在此管理 API Key，或在 OMP 终端中使用其他认证方式。"}}}},
