    "Another Git operation holds this worktree's index. Wait for it to finish, then refresh." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "另一个 Git 操作正在占用此 worktree 的暂存区。请等待完成后刷新。"}}}},
    "The branch or staged contents changed. Refresh and review them before trying again." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "分支或暂存内容已变化。请刷新并审阅后重试。"}}}},
    "This index cannot be updated safely here. Use Git in a terminal." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "无法在此安全更新暂存区。请在终端中使用 Git。"}}}},
    "Finish the ongoing Git operation or resolve conflicts in a terminal before staging or committing here." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "请先在终端中完成正在进行的 Git 操作或解决冲突，再在此暂存或提交。"}}}},
    "Stage changes before committing." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "请先暂存更改，再提交。"}}}},
    "Enter a commit message of at most 64 KiB without NUL characters." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "请输入不超过 64 KiB 且不含 NUL 字符的提交说明。"}}}},
    "An OMP task is active in this worktree. Wait for it to finish before staging or committing." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "此 worktree 中有 OMP 任务正在运行。请等待完成后再暂存或提交。"}}}},
    "The commit result could not be confirmed. Your message is kept. Inspect Git history before making another commit." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "无法确认提交结果。提交说明已保留。请先检查 Git 历史，再进行下一次提交。"}}}},
    "Git created commit %@, but its hooks changed the reviewed contents or the index could not be synchronized. Inspect the commit and staging in a terminal before continuing." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Git 已创建提交 %@，但 hooks 改变了已审阅的内容，或暂存区无法同步。请先在终端中检查该提交及暂存区，再继续操作。"}}}},
    "Updating Git…" : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "正在更新 Git…"}}}},
    "Committed %@" : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已提交 %@"}}}},
    "Could not generate a commit message. Your draft is unchanged." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "无法生成提交说明。草稿未更改。"}}}},
    "Write a message from staged changes" : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "根据暂存更改生成提交说明"}}}},
