    "Add a server to the active OMP profile. OMP manages connections and sign-in; new conversations use the saved configuration." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "将服务器添加到活动 OMP profile。连接与登录由 OMP 管理，新对话将使用保存的配置。"}}}},
    "Get a key or token" : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "获取密钥或 token"}}}},
    "OMP will open your browser to sign in and keep credentials in its native credential store." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "OMP 将打开浏览器完成登录，并将凭据保存在原生凭据库中。"}}}},
    "Values are saved in OMP's native MCP configuration. Environment references are kept literally; local packages run only when OMP starts a conversation." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "这些值会保存到 OMP 原生 MCP 配置。环境变量引用会原样保留；本地包只在 OMP 启动对话时运行。"}}}},
    "Add and sign in" : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "添加并登录"}}}},
    "Sign in with OMP" : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "通过 OMP 登录"}}}},
    "Sign in to %@ with OMP" : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "通过 OMP 登录 %@"}}}},
    "OMP manages authorization and credentials. Sign-in does not verify the server's tools or connection." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "授权与凭据由 OMP 管理。登录并不验证服务器的工具或连接。"}}}},
    "The browser could not be opened. Open the link above manually." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "无法打开浏览器。请手动打开上方链接。"}}}},
    "Authorization response" : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "授权响应"}}}},
    "Signed in with OMP. New conversations will use this authorization." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "已通过 OMP 登录。新对话将使用此授权。"}}}},
    "Enter %@." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "请输入%@。"}}}},
    "Native MCP sign-in requires an OMP npm SDK installation and Bun. You can also sign in with /mcp reauth in OMP." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "原生 MCP 登录需要 OMP npm SDK 和 Bun。你也可以在 OMP 中通过 /mcp reauth 登录。"}}}},
    "Paste the callback URL or authorization code." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "粘贴回调 URL 或授权码。"}}}},
    "OMP did not confirm MCP sign-in." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "OMP 未确认 MCP 登录成功。"}}}},
    "MCP sign-in failed. Try again in OMP." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MCP 登录失败。请在 OMP 中重试。"}}}},
    "MCP sign-in requires a remote server." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MCP 登录需要远程服务器。"}}}},
    "MCP sign-in requires an HTTP endpoint without URL credentials." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MCP 登录需要 URL 中不含凭据的 HTTP 端点。"}}}},
    "OMP could not discover OAuth endpoints for this server." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "OMP 无法发现此服务器的 OAuth 端点。"}}}},
    "This OMP SDK does not support native MCP sign-in." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "此 OMP SDK 不支持原生 MCP 登录。"}}}},
    "MCP sign-in timed out." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "MCP 登录超时。"}}}},
