    "One argument per field, without shell quoting. For npx, add -y and the package name; for uvx, add the package name first." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "每个输入框填写一个参数，无需 shell 引号。npx 需依次添加 -y 和包名；uvx 的第一个参数为包名。"}}}},
