    "Values stay literal. OMP resolves environment references and !commands when connecting." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "值按原文保存。OMP 在连接时解析环境变量引用和 !命令。"}}}},
    "View and manage servers in the active OMP profile. Project MCP configurations are excluded." : {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "查看和管理当前活动 OMP profile 中的服务器，不包含项目 MCP 配置。"}}}},
