      }
    },
    "Each head after the first gets a panel of its own beside the chat while there is room, left and right until each side is full; the usage panel keeps its spot." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "除第一个外，每个子智能体在空间允许时都会在对话旁获得独立面板，先左后右，直到两侧排满；用量面板位置保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each head gets one brief and a panel of its own beside the chat, all working at the same time." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个子智能体各领一份简报，在对话旁拥有自己的面板，并同时工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each head gets one brief and a panel of its own beside the chat. Hank, Walter, Ada and the rest work at the same time." : {
