    "Disabled. Codex deletion also deletes descendant sessions, without an atomic safeguard against newly active work. Claude Code and Antigravity have no verified deletion operation for these connected sessions." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已禁用。Codex 的删除操作还会删除其后代会话，且没有针对新近活跃工作的原子性保护。Claude Code 和 Antigravity 对这些已连接的会话没有经过验证的删除操作。"
