    "These controls affect Codex's local CLI/app session history, independently of Tivano's sidebar. They do not manage conversations on provider websites. Heads with descendants or an unconfirmed idle state are not archived. Changing this setting never sweeps existing history." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些设置影响 Codex 本地 CLI/应用的会话历史，与 Tivano 的侧边栏相互独立。它们不会管理服务商网站上的对话。有后代会话或空闲状态未得到确认的子智能体不会被归档。更改此设置不会清理已有的历史记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
