    "OMP GUI couldn't read its library (%@). The original file and chat documents are preserved. Repair the library and restart OMP GUI. Any new chats will be saved separately to %@ when you quit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OMP GUI 无法读取资料库（%@）。原文件和会话文档已保留。请修复资料库后重启 OMP GUI。退出时，新建会话会另存至 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OMP GUI couldn't save your changes to disk. Your chats are kept in memory and saving will be retried. Free up disk space or check folder permissions before quitting.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OMP GUI 无法将更改保存到磁盘。会话仍保留在内存中，保存会继续重试。退出前请释放磁盘空间或检查文件夹权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep your Mac awake while OMP GUI runs tasks. The display can turn off, and you can still sleep manually or close the lid.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
